# ICS is a CRLF format by RFC 5545. Git's autocrlf normalisation would
# store these blobs LF-only, and the bytes committed here are the bytes
# GitHub Pages serves to calendar clients. Exempt them from all text
# conversion so what the fetcher writes is what subscribers receive.
*.ics -text
*.woff2 binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.webp binary
